      "text": "### The Three-Phase System"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-GEOTECHNICAL.md#007",
      "path": [
        "04-GEOTECHNICAL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:structural:04-geotechnical, git-history:structural:04-geotechnical]",
        "canonical_path": "structural/04-GEOTECHNICAL.md",
        "concepts": "[geotechnical]",
        "current_path": "structural/04-GEOTECHNICAL.md",
        "id": "maxim:structural:geotechnical",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "structural",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[geotechnical]",
        "section": "structural",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "04 - Geotechnical Engineering",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n       ┌─────┐\n       │  A  │\n       │─────│\n       │  W  │\n       │─────│\n       │  S  │\n       └─────┘\n       A = Air     (volume V_a)\n       W = Water   (volume V_w, mass M_w)\n       S = Solids  (volume V_s, mass M_s)"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-GEOTECHNICAL.md#008",
      "path": [
        "04-GEOTECHNICAL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:structural:04-geotechnical, git-history:structural:04-geotechnical]",
        "canonical_path": "structural/04-GEOTECHNICAL.md",
        "concepts": "[geotechnical]",
        "current_path": "structural/04-GEOTECHNICAL.md",
        "id": "maxim:structural:geotechnical",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "structural",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[geotechnical]",
        "section": "structural",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "04 - Geotechnical Engineering",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Total volume: V = V_s + V_v   where V_v = V_a + V_w (void volume)\nTotal mass:   M = M_s + M_w   (air mass neglected)\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-GEOTECHNICAL.md#009",
      "path": [
        "04-GEOTECHNICAL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:structural:04-geotechnical, git-history:structural:04-geotechnical]",
        "canonical_path": "structural/04-GEOTECHNICAL.md",
        "concepts": "[geotechnical]",
        "current_path": "structural/04-GEOTECHNICAL.md",
        "id": "maxim:structural:geotechnical",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "structural",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[geotechnical]",
        "section": "structural",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "04 - Geotechnical Engineering",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Phase relationships:**\n```\nVoid ratio:        e = V_v/V_s    (ranges 0.3–1.5 for soils)\nPorosity:          n = V_v/V = e/(1+e)\nDegree of saturation: S_r = V_w/V_v  (0 = dry, 1 = fully saturated)\nWater content:     w = M_w/M_s    (decimal or %)"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-GEOTECHNICAL.md#010",
      "path": [
        "04-GEOTECHNICAL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:structural:04-geotechnical, git-history:structural:04-geotechnical]",
        "canonical_path": "structural/04-GEOTECHNICAL.md",
        "concepts": "[geotechnical]",
        "current_path": "structural/04-GEOTECHNICAL.md",
        "id": "maxim:structural:geotechnical",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "structural",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[geotechnical]",
        "section": "structural",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "04 - Geotechnical Engineering",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Dry unit weight:   γ_d = G_s γ_w / (1+e)\nSaturated:         γ_sat = (G_s + e) γ_w / (1+e)\nSubmerged:         γ' = γ_sat − γ_w   (buoyant unit weight)"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-GEOTECHNICAL.md#011",
      "path": [
        "04-GEOTECHNICAL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:structural:04-geotechnical, git-history:structural:04-geotechnical]",
