        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "04 - Geotechnical Engineering",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "where G_s = specific gravity of solids ≈ 2.65–2.72 for most minerals\n      γ_w = 9.81 kN/m³ (unit weight of water)\n```"
    },
